      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَبِيبٌ</span></b>  The <i>point,</i> or <i>edge,</i> (syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدّ</span>, [in an. ex.
